  "summary": "C5 reads the 60x60 region subset for 1991-12-27..2003-01-05 plus the 2020 summer and saves A.npy; C6 builds per-cell hazen 90th-percentile thresholds from \u00b15-day pools, smooths them with a wrapping 31-day mean, compares the target SST against them, and detects runs and joins gaps to write the mask. Because the target days are day-of-year 153\u2013244, the smoothing reads raw thresholds only for days 138\u2013259, so only baseline SST from May 12 to Sep 20 of each year reaches the mask; the climatology is unused."
